<title>GREECE: Greek Oct CPI inflation fell to 8.3pct y/y-source.</title>
<headline>Greek Oct CPI inflation fell to 8.3pct y/y-source.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Greek CPI-based inflation fell to 8.3 percent in October from 8.3 percent in September, a monetary source told Reuters.</p>
<p>-- Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
